      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "So, I'm back from a ten-month secondment spent primarily commissioning articles for all the RCNi specialist titles. I found the change of pace, the breadth of outlook and the increase of autonomy invigorating, but I am glad to be back as editor of Nursing Management. First of all, I'd like to thank Sophie Blakemore, now on maternity leave, for her excellent editorship of the journal since March last year; she's going to be a tough act to follow."},
